html:
{%- set fam = doc.family_members or [] -%}
{%- set emp_addr = doc.current_address or doc.permanent_address or "" -%}
{%- macro val(v) -%}{{ v if v else "&nbsp;" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro fdate(d) -%}{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(d, "dd-MM-yyyy") if d else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro addr(r) -%}{{ r.address or (emp_addr if r.residing_with_employee else (r.place_of_residence or "")) }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro age(d) -%}{{ ((frappe.utils.date_diff(frappe.utils.nowdate(), d) / 365.25) | int) if d else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set company = frappe.db.get_value("Company", doc.company, ["pf_establishment_code", "esic_establishment_code"], as_dict=True) or {} -%}
{%- set co_links = frappe.get_all("Dynamic Link", filters={"link_doctype": "Company", "link_name": doc.company, "parenttype": "Address"}, pluck="parent", limit=1) -%}
{%- set ca = frappe.db.get_value("Address", co_links[0], ["address_line1", "address_line2", "city", "state", "pincode"], as_dict=True) if co_links else none -%}
{%- set co_address = ([ca.address_line1, ca.address_line2, ca.city, ca.state, ca.pincode] | select | join(", ")) if ca else "" -%}

<style>
	.sf { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px; color: #000; line-height: 1.35; }
	.sf h3 { font-size: 13px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 2px; }
	.sf .sub { text-align: center; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
	.sf table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; page-break-inside: avoid; }
	.sf td, .sf th { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 4px 6px; vertical-align: top; }
	.sf th { background: #eee; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
	.sf .n { width: 4%; text-align: center; }
	.sf .q { width: 38%; }
	.sf .part { font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 8px 0 3px; }
	.sf .sign td { border: none; padding-top: 24px; }
	.sf .blank { display: inline-block; min-width: 150px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
	.sf p { margin: 3px 0; }
	.sf .box { display: inline-block; width: 11px; height: 11px; border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center; font-size: 9px; line-height: 11px; vertical-align: middle; }
</style>
{%- set nominees = fam | selectattr("pf_nominee_share") | list -%}
{%- set eps_family = fam | selectattr("relation", "in", ["Spouse", "Son", "Daughter"]) | list -%}
<div class="sf">
	<h3>FORM 2 (Revised)</h3>
	<div class="sub"><b>NOMINATION AND DECLARATION FORM FOR UNEXEMPTED / EXEMPTED ESTABLISHMENTS</b><br>
	Declaration and Nomination Form under the Employees' Provident Funds and Employees' Pension Schemes<br>
	(Paragraphs 33 and 61(1) of the Employees' Provident Funds Scheme, 1952 and Paragraph 18 of the Employees' Pension Scheme, 1995)</div>
	<table>
		<tr><td class="n">1</td><td class="q">Name (in block letters)</td><td>{{ (doc.employee_name or "") | upper }}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n">2</td><td class="q">{{ "Spouse's" if doc.father_spouse_relation == "Spouse" else "Father's" }} / Husband's Name</td><td>{{ val(doc.father_or_husband_name) }}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n">3</td><td class="q">Date of Birth</td><td>{{ val(fdate(doc.date_of_birth)) }}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n">4</td><td class="q">Sex</td><td>{{ val(doc.gender) }}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n">5</td><td class="q">Marital Status</td><td>{{ val(doc.marital_status) }}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n">6</td><td class="q">Account No. (PF) / UAN</td><td>{{ val(doc.get("provident_fund_account")) }}{% if doc.uan_number %} &nbsp; UAN: {{ doc.uan_number }}{% endif %}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n">7</td><td class="q">Address - Permanent</td><td>{{ val(doc.permanent_address) }}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n"></td><td class="q">Address - Temporary</td><td>{{ val(doc.current_address) }}</td></tr>
		<tr><td class="n">8</td><td class="q">Date of joining EPF / EPS</td><td>{{ val(fdate(doc.date_of_joining)) }}</td></tr>
	</table>

	<div class="part">PART - A (EPF)</div>
	<p>I hereby nominate the person(s) / cancel the nomination made by me previously and nominate the person(s) mentioned below to receive the amount standing to my credit in the Employees' Provident Fund, in the event of my death.</p>
	<table>
		<tr><th style="width:16%">Name of the nominee(s)</th><th style="width:24%">Address</th><th style="width:11%">Nominee's relationship with the member</th><th style="width:11%">Date of Birth</th><th style="width:14%">Total amount or share of accumulations in Provident Fund to be paid to each nominee</th><th>If the nominee is a minor, name, relationship &amp; address of the guardian who may receive the amount during the minority of the nominee</th></tr>
		{% for r in nominees %}
		<tr><td>{{ r.member_name }}</td><td>{{ addr(r) }}</td><td>{{ r.relation }}</td><td style="white-space:nowrap">{{ fdate(r.date_of_birth) }}</td><td style="text-align:center">{{ "%g" | format(r.pf_nominee_share) }}%</td><td>{{ r.guardian_name or "" }}{% if r.guardian_relation %} ({{ r.guardian_relation }}){% endif %}</td></tr>
		{% endfor %}
		{% for i in range([3 - (nominees | length), 0] | max) %}
		<tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
		{% endfor %}
	</table>
	<p>1. * Certified that I have no family as defined in para 2(g) of the Employees' Provident Funds Scheme, 1952 and should I acquire a family hereafter, the above nomination should be deemed as cancelled.</p>
	<p>2. * Certified that my father / mother is / are dependent upon me.</p>
	<p style="font-size:9px">* Strike out whichever is not applicable.</p>
	<table class="sign"><tr><td></td><td style="text-align:right">Signature or thumb impression of the subscriber</td></tr></table>

	<div class="part">PART - B (EPS) (Para 18)</div>
	<p>I hereby furnish below particulars of the members of my family who would be eligible to receive widow / children pension in the event of my death.</p>
	<table>
		<tr><th style="width:6%">Sr. No.</th><th>Name &amp; address of the family member</th><th style="width:15%">Date of Birth</th><th style="width:20%">Relationship with the member</th></tr>
		{% for r in eps_family %}
		<tr><td style="text-align:center">{{ loop.index }}</td><td>{{ r.member_name }}{% if addr(r) %}, {{ addr(r) }}{% endif %}</td><td>{{ fdate(r.date_of_birth) }}</td><td>{{ r.relation }}</td></tr>
		{% endfor %}
		{% for i in range([2 - (eps_family | length), 0] | max) %}
		<tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
		{% endfor %}
	</table>
	<p>** Certified that I have no family, as defined in para 2(vii) of the Employees' Pension Scheme, 1995 and should I acquire a family hereafter I shall furnish particulars thereon in the above form.</p>
	<p>I hereby nominate the following person for receiving the monthly widow pension (admissible under para 16 2(a)(i) &amp; (ii)) in the event of my death without leaving any eligible family member for receiving pension.</p>
	<table>
		<tr><th>Name and address of the nominee</th><th style="width:15%">Date of Birth</th><th style="width:20%">Relationship with member</th></tr>
		{% if not eps_family and nominees %}{% set r = nominees[0] %}
		<tr><td>{{ r.member_name }}{% if addr(r) %}, {{ addr(r) }}{% endif %}</td><td>{{ fdate(r.date_of_birth) }}</td><td>{{ r.relation }}</td></tr>
		{% else %}<tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td></td><td></td></tr>{% endif %}
	</table>
	<table class="sign"><tr><td>Date: <span class="blank">&nbsp;</span></td><td style="text-align:right">Signature or thumb impression of the subscriber</td></tr></table>

	<div class="part">CERTIFICATE BY EMPLOYER</div>
	<p>Certified that the above declaration and nomination has been signed / thumb impressed before me by Shri / Smt. / Kum. <b>{{ doc.employee_name }}</b> employed in my establishment after he / she has read the entries / the entries have been read over to him / her by me and got confirmed by him / her.</p>
	<table class="sign"><tr>
		<td>Place: <span class="blank">&nbsp;</span><br>Date: <span class="blank">&nbsp;</span></td>
		<td style="text-align:right">Signature of the employer or other authorised officer of the establishment<br>Designation: <span class="blank">&nbsp;</span><br>
		Name &amp; address of the Factory / Establishment: <b>{{ doc.company }}</b>{% if co_address %}, {{ co_address }}{% endif %}{% if company.pf_establishment_code %}<br>PF Code: {{ company.pf_establishment_code }}{% endif %}</td>
	</tr></table>
</div>
